ed_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5793,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:39:14Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":22,"created_at":"2025-10-12T23:40:38Z","updated_at":"2026-09-12T03:38:51Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111568","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111568","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111568.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111568.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Part of https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1934\r\n\r\nThis PR adds support for sheen shading, which allows for the easier and more realistic creation of cloth materials like cotton, velvet, silk, etc.\r\n\r\nIt only has 3 inputs:\r\n\r\n- **SHEEN:** to control the intensity of the effect.\r\n- **SHEEN_ROUGHNESS:** to adjust the level of roughness or glossiness.\r\n- **SHEEN_COLOR:** to change the specular reflectance color.\r\n\r\nIn the StandardMaterial3D, you can place a texture with the following information:\r\n\r\n- R (Red channel): A mask to indicate which parts are cloth and which parts are not.\r\n- G (Green channel): A roughness map to provide variations in reflections.\r\n\r\nHere are some usage examples so you can see how it looks.\r\n| Cloth Ball | Sweater(cotton) |\r\n|--------------|--------------|\r\n|<img width=\"576\" height=\"324\" alt=\"cloth\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/821654a4-9dfb-4e7b-8812-6612e8e51234\" />|<img width=\"576\" height=\"324\" alt=\"sweater\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5b9c2da1-824f-46c5-b6a7-24135c5b6bda\" />|\r\n\r\n| Dress(silk) |Chair(velvet) |\r\n|--------------|--------------|\r\n|<img width=\"576\" height=\"324\" alt=\"dress\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dfd4d312-09ed-4ebb-a81e-259f4c76233e\" />|<img width=\"576\" height=\"324\" alt=\"chair\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2bd0775-57a6-4ba8-9e9d-5a04d1915524\" />|\r\n\r\n### ⚠️ Important notes ⚠️\r\n\r\n- There is no support for the mobile and compatibility renderers because they do not support DFG LUT see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103934.\r\n- This implementation is based on Google's Filament, which introduces the following artifacts occur when sheen roughness is set to <= 0.3.\r\n<img width=\"576\" height=\"324\" alt=\"artifacts(white)\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a5eb683-47e7-45a2-90f7-0b162e0c7c41\" />\r\n<img width=\"576\" height=\"324\" alt=\"artifacts(red)\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/960a7690-d7c0-4de7-859a-9efed53e9966\" />\r\n\r\nI haven't taken the time to report it, nor do I know how it can be solved.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111568/reactions","total_count":31,"+1":16,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":5,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":10},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111568/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}